{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00186",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.02,
      "end_seconds": 2.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "hello, come through"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.93,
      "end_seconds": 7.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. Thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.75,
      "end_seconds": 10.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Okay, busy day out there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.5,
      "end_seconds": 15.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "always is. The traffic coming in was terrible"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.65,
      "end_seconds": 18.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "So, how have things been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.6,
      "end_seconds": 24.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Hmm, I wanted to get constipation looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.49,
      "end_seconds": 28.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "How far back does it go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.63,
      "end_seconds": 32.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "oh, it's been two days now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.63,
      "end_seconds": 37.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Right, anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.91,
      "end_seconds": 56.37,
      "duration_seconds": 17.46,
      "text": "when it starts I tend to get a fever for days as well. Uh, you know, with fever for days, I'd call it severe. It's every other day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.96,
      "end_seconds": 60.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.76,
      "end_seconds": 70.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "I've got diabetes i wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.73,
      "end_seconds": 81.05,
      "duration_seconds": 9.32,
      "text": "Right, so diabetes is already on your record. We'll keep that that in mind today. What's your current medication list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.68,
      "end_seconds": 90.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "I take something called metf... metformin, 500 milligrams, maybe, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.12,
      "end_seconds": 94.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.31,
      "end_seconds": 106.33,
      "duration_seconds": 10.02,
      "text": "Oh, not with me. I'll bring it next time. I'm on Dolo, 650 milligrams, when I get the fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.29,
      "end_seconds": 109.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Any procedures or operations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.78,
      "end_seconds": 115.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Just cataract surgery on my right eye, last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.75,
      "end_seconds": 118.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "so, do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.5,
      "end_seconds": 121.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "I've never smoked"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.49,
      "end_seconds": 124.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "so, do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.85,
      "end_seconds": 130.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.11,
      "end_seconds": 134.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "are you working at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.85,
      "end_seconds": 141.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Yes, I'm a nurse on a busy ward."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.39,
      "end_seconds": 145.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "do you get any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.14,
      "end_seconds": 154.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "I walk for about half an hour most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.73,
      "end_seconds": 175.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Any rash, cough or vomiting at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.4,
      "end_seconds": 185.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "I mean, no, no rash, cough or vomiting"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.9,
      "end_seconds": 189.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Any jaundice or blood in the stool at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.0,
      "end_seconds": 194.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "No, no jaundice or blood in the stool."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.09,
      "end_seconds": 199.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.05,
      "end_seconds": 202.03,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "no rashes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 215.41,
      "end_seconds": 222.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pulse 100, blood pressure 126 over 67, temperature is 38.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.86,
      "end_seconds": 224.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.47,
      "end_seconds": 230.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Let me examine, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.28,
      "end_seconds": 245.98,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.84,
      "end_seconds": 249.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Hold that position for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.9,
      "end_seconds": 272.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Your tummy is a bit full and tender in the lower part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.47,
      "end_seconds": 278.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "okay, stay still while I have a look"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.03,
      "end_seconds": 293.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I can't feel your liver or spleen enlarged"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.37,
      "end_seconds": 321.23,
      "duration_seconds": 23.86,
      "text": "Thanks, please take a seat again. So where does that leave us? I'd lean towards typhoid fever, which we need to confirm. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. Let's get a full blood count, for fever. Eat only home-cooked food and drink boiled or bottled water while this is going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.48,
      "end_seconds": 340.66,
      "duration_seconds": 19.18,
      "text": "Okay, so. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. One warning sign to remember: the fever stays high or the tummy pain gets sharp. In that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.81,
      "end_seconds": 345.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Got it, um, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.69,
      "end_seconds": 350.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the results are back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 351.91,
      "end_seconds": 354.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Sure, um, that's doable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.32,
      "end_seconds": 358.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Thanks for coming in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.84,
      "end_seconds": 364.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "right thanks again"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.52,
      "end_seconds": 368.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
